<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  PrintTheShot — 应用名与界面文案 / app name and UI strings
  =========================================================

  中文
  ====
  桌面上显示的应用名来自 @string/app_name。`npx cap add android` 生成的工程里
  也有一份 strings.xml,但内容是 Capacitor 按 capacitor.config.json 的 appName
  写进去的 —— 这里显式再声明一次,好处是应用名不依赖生成时机:

    - 先跑 cap add、后来才改 appName,生成工程里还是旧名字;
    - 这份文件跟着仓库走,clone 下来名字就是对的。

  资源合并时同名条目以本目录(app/src/main)为准,会覆盖生成工程里的值。

  English
  =======
  The name shown on the launcher comes from @string/app_name. The project produced
  by `npx cap add android` has its own strings.xml, but its contents are whatever
  Capacitor wrote from appName at generation time. Declaring it here as well means
  the name does not depend on when generation happened:

    - run cap add first, change appName later, and the generated project still
      carries the old name;
    - this file travels with the repository, so a fresh clone has the right name.

  During resource merging, entries in this directory (app/src/main) win over the
  generated project's values.
-->
<resources>
    <string name="app_name">PrintTheShotNext</string>
</resources>
